| Test | Result | Numeric evidence |
|---|---:|---|
| T7 Sleep/Wake Grid2D persistence | **PASS** | before-deactivate full-scan 71/1024 nonzero (t=8.3s); while-deactivated 71 with **identical values** (`hold_identical_during_sleep=true`, t=11.1s); after-reactivate 70 nonzero, values decayed naturally (t=13.8s). Wake zero-overwrite disproven. |
| T8 Material V-flip in PIE | **BLOCKED** | RT write proven (scan 71 nonzero); remaining work is the worldXY->UV emissive material graph + PIE viewport pixel comparison. |
| T9 Three-system concurrent | **PASS** | Ground/Grass/Water RTs each 71 nonzero at the same world time (t=27.4s). Cross-talk caveat stands (identical deterministic pattern; needs per-system signature). |
